The files in this directory (raw/alicante.osm.json and city.json) contain data from
OpenStreetMap, © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
city.json is a derived database produced by tools/build-city.mjs and is also licensed under ODbL 1.0.

raw/dem5.asc holds the 5 m digital terrain model MDT05 (PNOA LiDAR) of the Instituto Geográfico Nacional,
© Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CNIG), licensed CC BY 4.0 (https://www.ign.es/web/ign/portal/licencias),
fetched once through the INSPIRE WCS service (tools/fetch-dem.mjs). terrain.bin is derived from it by
tools/build-city.mjs (roads and car parks carved in, the sea flattened) and carries the same attribution.
